{"id":"relativ","lemma":"relativ","pos":"adj","rank":4768,"glosses":["relative"],"ipa":"/ʁelaˈtiːf/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/cc/De-relativ.ogg/De-relativ.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"relativer","superlative":"am relativsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Das ist relativ einfach.","en":"Doing that is relatively easy.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"easy"}]},{"text":"Alles im Leben ist relativ.","en":"Everything in life is relative.","words":[{"g":"everything"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"a state in which…"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Der Laden war relativ leer.","en":"The store was relatively empty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/790554","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"shop"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"empty"}]},{"text":"Sie spricht relativ schnell.","en":"She speaks relatively fast.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to speak","l":"sprechen"},null,{"g":"quickly"}]},{"text":"Ich bin mir da relativ sicher.","en":"I feel pretty sure of that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"there"},null,{"g":"safely"}]}]}